          },
          "description": "Grab your boots—it’s time for a musical farm adventure!In this 20-minute farmyard journey, children will listen to animal sounds, count eggs and hatch chicks, gallop like horses, plant apple seeds, and sing along to “Old MacDonald.” The fun concludes with a story about the animals they vistied on the farm! Led by Kindermusik’s guided audio, this self-paced experience blends music, movement, and imagination to support early development and keep young learners joyfully engaged from start to finish.",
